==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**50 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**20 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stack up as many [[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cats]] as you can before triggering the boss wave. Along with [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], you have to hope that their [[Wave Attack]]s obliterate Tackey before Dark Dober shows up. If you can pull this off, you're in the clear to send out [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] to quickly whittle down Dark Dober and hopefully kill him before the second Tackey makes its way to the frontlines. It's extremely difficult to fight them together, so pull out all the stops you need to ensure Tackey is not present, afterwards the stage becomes as simple as spamming Talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazers]], [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]]s, and Pizza Cats. Other good options to burst down Tackey are [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Soractes]]' Conjure and Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Lord Gravey can still pose a problem with the second Tackey supporting him, so stay on guard for cleanup.

==Trivia==
*Mass-Chashu-Sets is a pun on ''[[wikipedia:Massachusetts|Massachusetts]]'' and チャーシュー ''chā shū'' ([[wikipedia:char siu|char siu]]). Its Japanese name, Torori Chā-shū (トロリチャー州, "Melty Char Province"), combines チャーシュー ''chā shū'' with 州 ''shū'' (province).

